{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408130/extras/TopLevelDescriptionImage.png?t=1740692601\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Quarked Up Omnibus, a solar system of authored planets to explore, rooms to clean, entities to chat with, and a resort that doesn\u2019t seem as it is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408130/extras/SectionTitle_CleanUpWorld.png?t=1740692601\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world is a mess, and you are a janitor. Your job is to clean, but that doesn\u2019t stop you from cleaning the mess that you see everywhere you go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408130/extras/CleanUpWorld.gif?t=1740692601\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408130/extras/SectionTitle_Unlock.png?t=1740692601\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t worry, you will be rewarded for your hard work via Resort tokens, this wonderful currency, <i>only legal at resort certified shops</i>, allows you to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new cleaning tools to become more efficient</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your ship to improve exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throw it all into getting random knick-knacks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408130/extras/UseTokenMachines_OneUnlock.gif?t=1740692601\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408130/extras/SectionTitle_EscapeResort.png?t=1740692601\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You work as a janitor at a school on a small planet, but you have higher ambitions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When your boss sends you to a fancy unknown resort for doing a great job, at first you feel as though you are finally being noticed and on your way to the top. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This quickly changes when the day to leave the resort comes and goes, and your daily events turn into daily jobs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You must gather a team to escape while keeping your wits about.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408130/extras/FlyingAround_Space.gif?t=1740692601\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1408130?t=1740692601","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408130/6afdff1de3599809d9aeca5ab189bc9b3b8303bf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740692601","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408130/bdf8492bf723b9423a1e66875f2217196257e4f0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740692601","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408130/bdf8492bf723b9423a1e66875f2217196257e4f0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740692601","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Mature themes that involve death."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408130/extras/TopLevelDescriptionImage.png?t=1740692601\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Quarked Up Omnibus, a solar system of authored planets to explore, rooms to clean, entities to chat with, and a resort that doesn\u2019t seem as it is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p