rt comes and goes, and your daily events turn into daily jobs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You must gather a team to escape while keeping your wits about.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408130/extras/FlyingAround_Space.gif?t=1740692601\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2>","developers":["Graham Park"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408130/3b6b9cae15dffe4a6af17475d99d7b75591f62c7/header.jpg?t=1740692601","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257043268,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257043268/movie480.mp4?t=1723762135","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257043268/movie_max.mp4?t=1723762135"},"name":"Vertical Slice","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257043268/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1723762135","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257043268/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1723762135","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257043268/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1723762135"}}],"name":"Quarked Up Omnibus: Clean - Fix - Escape","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 1400 Quad-Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> AMD Streaming Audio Device</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Graham Park"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Linguagem impr\u00f3pria\nMedo","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","require